invariant: INV-16
file: quic.c
catches: quic_loop_widemul
reason: a Handshake packet ch_quic_seal seals runs its Poly1305 under CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED
  whatever the session answered, so the answer picks nothing there. The
  packet is the same. test/quic_loop_widemul.h seals and opens a packet
  at each level each way and requires an end that answers
  CH_WIDEMUL_CONSTANT_TIME to call no file under its own names.

--- old
        return quic_packet_seal(widemul_answer(&q->t.cfg), &q->handshake_tx, &q->handshake_hp_tx,
--- new
        return quic_packet_seal(CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, &q->handshake_tx, &q->handshake_hp_tx,
